  "details": "While holding the camera in a moving station (The faster the more apparent), some form of camera stuttering begins to occur as if the camera's position lags behind every few frames. Letting go of the camera fixes this issue, but anytime grabbing and holding the camera, it starts again. Worlds with fast moving vehicles such as 'Test Pilots' are the most noticeable locations to see this happen. \n\nThis issue may have popped up sometime between early October 2024 and late December of 2024. I have only been able to test on PCVR.",
